{
  "bookId": "rewind-46",
  "id": "chapter-186",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "38605001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "广播",
          "text": "「你的身体在黑暗中沉睡，你的灵魂在此彷徨，前去寻找吧，在黑暗中寻找水晶球的指引，一切只为寻回自己……」",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38605002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "广播",
          "text": "「向伟大的水晶球提问吧，答案就在其中——！」",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38605003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "看样子是需要找到某个特定的水晶球呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38605004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "总之，先按照指引走吧，按理来说应该会遇到工作人员，到时候再伺机探听消息……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38605005",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "唰啦——哗啦——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38605006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "架子后有翻书声……？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38605007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "谁在那里！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38605008",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "哇啊啊怎么这么快被发现了！就说这个台本太厚了啦，一直在修道具，根本没时间背啊！",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38605009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "咳咳，真是敏锐，我是你的引导者，伟大水晶球的使者，桑尼。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38605010",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "是引导的工作人员？还不宜打草惊蛇……继续伪装成普通的游客吧。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38605011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "报上名来吧，迷茫的灵魂——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38605012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "叫我奥莉安娜就可以。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38605013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "唔，作为找到我的奖励，就由我为你照亮前往水晶球的道路吧，不必言谢……来，生者奥莉安娜，跟着我念。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38605014",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "米娅莫拉苏娜丹妮！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38605015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "米娅……莫拉苏……娜丹妮？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38605016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "大点声，你的灵力还不足以照亮道路！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38605017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "米娅莫拉苏娜丹妮——！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38605018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "嗯！这下道路就会亮起……了……嗯？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38605019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38605020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38605021",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "米娅莫拉苏娜丹妮！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38605022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "居然一边大喊着跑走了，真是位有个性的工作人员，是道具出问题了吗……总之，先跟上吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38708001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "呼……米娅莫拉苏娜丹……呼……妮！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38708002",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "哇啊啊早知道不贪便宜买二手声控灯了，可恶……一整条路全都没亮。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38708003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "……追上你了，那边的就是水晶球？要不要先暂停找修理人员……？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38708004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "不不不……不必！伟大的水晶球不会受到一点点指引失误的影响，坐下吧，将手放到水晶球上面。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38708005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "那个，其实我们或许可以去找找别的工作人员……？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38708006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "唔唔，先别说话，水晶球的引导来了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38708007",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "刺啦——刺啦——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38708008",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "滋——滋——嘭——！",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38708009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "呜啊啊——！我的水晶球冒烟了——！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38708010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "「旧建筑中的电力系统隐患」……或许也是个不错的报道题目呢……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38708011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "才，才不是！这可是灵力！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38708012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "呜呜，再来一次！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38708013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "米娅莫拉苏娜丹妮！灵力注入！醒来吧，水晶球！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38708014",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "……滋……滋……咔……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38708015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "呜呜……水晶球的灵力完全散掉了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-932",
