      "title": "本格试胆大会·Ⅱ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "38607001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "嗯……根据照片里的痕迹方向来看的话……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38607002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "这个足迹似乎是延伸到后面的仓库区域了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38607003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "糟糕，后面的区域说不定会有危险。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38607004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "广播",
          "text": "滋啦——滋——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38607005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "不甘心……我好不甘心……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38607006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "果然无论是谁都会被生者的灵魂吸引，水晶球的使者竟然也不例外……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38607007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "幽灵的怨念不会轻易消散，诅咒的雕塑即将醒来——！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38607008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "滋————",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38607009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "是奇萝！她一直在准备雕塑，也不清楚怪谈的事。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38607010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "奇萝？是那个有名的雕塑家？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38607011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "对，这次的试胆大会是由我们两个一起主办的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38607012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "原本按照水晶球的指引，确实应该去奇萝负责的「雕塑广场」区域了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38607013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "走吧，我们需要把情况也告诉奇萝。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38710001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "到了，这里就是奇萝的雕塑广场。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38710002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "好真实的雕塑，这个风格，果然是我认识的那个奇萝……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38710003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "你也是奇萝的粉丝吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38710004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "我就说奇萝的雕塑是最棒的，嘿嘿。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38710005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "啊哈哈……对了，那现在我们要怎么找到她？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38710006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "按照试胆大会的规则，奇萝藏身在雕像群中。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38710007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "她就是雕像，雕像即是她。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38710008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "……所以，我们要从这么多雕像里找到奇萝？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38710009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "嗯……规则是这样的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38710010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "不愧是地狱级别的试胆大会啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38710011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "可以申请场外援助吗？比如请水晶球的使者占卜一下。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38710012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "奇萝的灵魂不能随意窥探……她同时拥有着生者与死者的灵魂……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38710013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "即使作为朋友的我，也难以承受知晓秘密的代价。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-934",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "oriana",
