      ],
      "title": "本格试胆大会·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "38608001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "如果是我知道的那个奇萝，或许可以用某样秘密武器——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38608002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "咳咳——哼——声音测试，声音测试。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38608003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "嗯，这个音量应该差不多。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38608004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "桑尼————！你那边听得到吗——？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38608005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "听——得——到——！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38608006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "好，那就开始，呼——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38608007",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "特报——！试胆大会突现怪谈，异样的脚印频繁出现，「地狱之门」究竟是何物？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38608008",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "「当流淌的夜色将街道尽数吞没，幽灵将穿过地狱之门再次行走于大地之上……」",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38608009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "（小声）「他……们的足……荧……闪烁……」",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38608010",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "某个远处的雕塑似乎轻微地晃了晃。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38608011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "嗯嗯？是新怪谈？但是听不清楚啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38608012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "我挪，我挪……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38608013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "（小声）「被选……定的生……行」",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38608014",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "某个远处的雕塑开始缓慢移动。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38608015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "糟糕，那边的声音听不见了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38608016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "我蹭，我蹭，嘿咻。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38608017",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "失踪少女至今仍未找到——！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38608018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "有人失踪，难道真的是幽灵？！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38608019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "但两者之间并无明显联系，所以本报记者认为——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38608020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇萝",
          "text": "当然肯定绝对是——幽灵啊！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38608021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "抓到你了！！！「雕塑」奇萝！！这次一定要让你接受专题采访！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38715001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇萝",
          "text": "……真是狡猾的生者，居然用全新的怪谈作为诱饵让我现身。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38715002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇萝",
          "text": "作为唤醒幽灵的代价，快告诉我更多「地狱之门」的情报，咯咯。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-935",
